WEBVTT

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:33.320
'Tis the season when the
cherry blossoms scatter,

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:35.480
and nature glows with vibrant green.

00:01:35.480 --> 00:01:38.000
The birds are singing,
the weather is perfect.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:38.950
It's time!

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:42.700
For the sports meet!

00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:50.080
Leaf Education Board

00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:50.080
Here to read the pledge of good
sportsmanship is our own Rock Lee!

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:53.300
I pledge!

00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:55.960
I can't believe they picked Bushy-Brows.

00:01:55.960 --> 00:01:58.510
You're just jealous that he's
the center of attention.

00:01:58.510 --> 00:02:01.140
No! I'm not...

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:04.680
You think he'll be able to
get through the whole thing?

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:06.060
Sure.

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:09.850
<b>Pledge</b>

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:09.850
He spent all day yesterday
memorizing it, he'll be fine.

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:09.850
<b>Focus!</b>

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:17.780
W-We... We... Uh...

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:19.990
<i>He's blanking!</i>

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:23.450
Um...

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:27.580
<i>Come on, Lee!</i>

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:30.330
<i>You were up all night
working on this, think!</i>

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:32.840
What's going on?

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:34.290
Did he forget his lines?

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:38.380
W-We... We...

00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:40.180
We all...

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:41.800
O ye...

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:45.180
W-We... are...

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:47.730
We are here today...

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:50.730
<i>He finally remembered.</i>

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:53.650
To celebrate our graduation!

00:02:56.730 --> 00:02:57.900
This isn't...

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:00.070
...a high school!

00:03:09.180 --> 00:03:13.150
<b>The Leaf Village Sports Meet</b>

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:17.710
I completely screwed that up.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:20.380
I practiced so hard, too.

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:22.960
Oh, well, it happens.

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:24.390
Don't let it get to you.

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:26.100
No!

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:31.100
I have to redeem myself by
coming in first in everything!

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:33.150
He got over it so quickly...

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:36.070
Even if you're upset,
that's getting too worked up!

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:38.780
Of course I'm worked up.

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:41.280
Besides, this isn't just about
reclaiming my honor.

00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:44.950
The sports meet has really
got my blood pumping!

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:50.450
The sports meet is a competition
to show off your athleticism!

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:54.460
You're right, and at the same
time so very, very wrong.

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:56.920
Since I can't use ninjutsu,

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:58.340
a sports competition is the perfect

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:00.130
chance for me to demonstrate my skills!

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:03.260
I have to produce, no matter what!

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:07.220
Where were you focusing all that power?!

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:08.950
If you mentally corner yourself,

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:11.270
it'll affect your nerves 
and you'll do even worse.

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:12.310
That's right!

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:17.410
If you strain yourself you'll only be

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:18.900
able to use half your strength, Lee.

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:21.030
So what should do?

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:23.110
Don't sweat it.

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:26.200
I know how hard you
try better than anyone.

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:29.120
You've been running at my
side for a long time now.

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:32.160
Every time you run together,
all the hard work ends up...

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:33.620
...being a bunch of random traipsing!

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:36.330
Have faith in yourself!

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:40.130
If you just go in with your usual level
of focus, you'll win for sure!

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:42.420
Remember that!

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:43.860
Yes! I will!

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:44.800
Hold up!

00:04:45.390 --> 00:04:47.510
Those are the wrong outfits!

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:53.930
So have you calmed down now, Lee?

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:56.060
Yup, I'm loose and relaxed.

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:57.860
That's too loose.

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:01.610
I'm going to sweep the whole meet.

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:04.740
I won't let you two beat me, either!

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:06.660
Talking big again, huh?

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:08.700
Looks like you're back to normal, Lee.

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:10.330
I hope so...

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:13.290
Our first event is the foot race!

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:15.210
<b>Exit</b>

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:19.040
<i>Have faith in yourself.</i>

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:21.630
<i>If I stay confident, I'll do fine!</i>

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:26.380
On your marks...

00:05:26.740 --> 00:05:28.970
Wow, no way!

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:30.680
Kakashi Sensei!

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:35.890
I'm not done yet!

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:41.940
'Scuse me, Bushy-Brows!

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:42.780
Oh, no—

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:47.910
I'm still not licked yet!

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:49.410
Rock Lee

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:04.420
The winner is Naruto!

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:06.550
I'm just getting started!

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:10.890
I'll win. I'll lose.

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:13.390
I'll win. I'll lose.

00:06:13.930 --> 00:06:16.180
Rock on, Naruto!

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:18.600
You cleaned house!

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:20.650
Yay!

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:22.110
It was more luck than anything.

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:24.440
It wasn't luck, I'm just that good!

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:27.110
I'm on the fast track to the championship!

00:06:27.110 --> 00:06:29.570
You're letting this get to you too much.

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:31.200
I'll win. I'll lose. I'll win.

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:31.200
You okay, Lee?

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:32.450
I'll lose...

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:34.950
This can't be happening.

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:39.040
Guy Sensei said if I just had
confidence, I'd win for sure.

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:42.960
Champion, champion, I'm number one!

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:41.460
Knock it off, you're being annoying!

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:42.960
Naruto...

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:44.960
Bushy-Brows?

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:46.090
Lee?

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:48.880
The battle's only just begun.

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:52.300
I swear... I swear, I'll...

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:53.970
I'll beat you, Naruto!

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:57.430
Oh, yeah? Bring it on!

00:06:57.950 --> 00:07:01.560
Our next competition
is the scavenger hunt.

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:05.320
Each competitor will draw
an item from the box.

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:04.480
Brush

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:07.820
They'll then have to find that item
and borrow it from someone.

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:10.820
The first person to successfully
cross the goal with their item wins!

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:11.240
<b>Winner!</b>

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:16.370
Lady Tsunade, what's the
key to winning a race like this?

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:17.580
Luck.

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:18.750
You heard her, folks.

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:22.920
Will Naruto continue his string of victories?

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:25.710
Will Rock Lee win his challenge
to the current leader?

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:28.670
Or will we see a new front-runner emerge?

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:28.670
On your marks...

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:32.340
I'm not going to lose this time, Naruto.

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:34.090
Let's rumble, Bushy-Brows.

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:36.430
Spread out, you two.

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:37.510
Get set...

00:07:37.510 --> 00:07:39.020
Whoa!

00:07:39.780 --> 00:07:41.770
And they're off!

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:43.520
Don't forget about me!

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:45.980
Neji Hyuga takes an early lead!

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:47.320
He's got his slip!

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:48.650
But something seems wrong.

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:51.490
"A somewhat melancholy...

00:07:51.490 --> 00:07:52.530
...ghost?"

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:56.030
What a shocking item to pull from the box!

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:57.790
How will he handle this?

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:02.000
I'm not going let this beat me!

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:04.220
Eight Trigrams Rotation!

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:04.880
<b>Exit</b>

00:08:04.220 --> 00:08:05.960
Where're you going, Neji?!

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:11.140
And Neji has left the arena
in search of a ghost.

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:15.930
Lady Tsunade, what would
you say went wrong for him?

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:16.930
Bad luck.

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:18.390
You heard her, folks.

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:22.640
Ah, Sakura's drawn her lot!

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:25.690
"A fleeting dream within a dream."

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:27.730
She's picked a very lightweight item!

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:30.320
How the heck am I supposed
to find something like this?!

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:33.650
The competitors find themselves
utterly stumped by their difficult tasks!

00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:36.280
It seems that Lady Tsunade's
analysis was correct.

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:37.240
It all comes down to luck!

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:40.700
<i>God, Buddha, whoever is
listening up there...</i>

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:42.500
<i>Please grant me some luck!</i>

00:08:42.810 --> 00:08:48.170
It's neither God nor Buddha.
It's says "sweet devil!"

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:50.170
Wasn't that a song by Candies in the 70's?

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:52.670
I don't have time to rent
 a copy of that now!

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:55.760
But I can't let Naruto win!

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:59.930
<i>Hopefully this'll result in
a way to help Lee, too.</i>

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:02.060
Tenten makes her pick.

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:04.440
"A thrilling conclusion where
 seeing your best friend killed...

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:07.150
...causes you to snap and
awakens your latent powers?!"

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:09.150
That's straight out of Dragon Ball!

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:12.230
This isn't a scavenger hunt,
it's a plagiarism fest!

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:13.820
Forget this mess!

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:15.740
You okay, Lee?

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:17.360
What is that?!

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:19.120
For the second stage...

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:21.160
Where did that summoning
circle come from?!

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:24.790
Now I just call this number...

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:27.170
You can summon demons over the phone?

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:30.750
Hi there, I'm at the sports meet track,

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:32.840
could you please send a demon right away?

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:36.630
Send a demon?! You sound
like you're calling a taxi!

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:36.630
Right, right, just turn at Shuuei—

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:40.100
I'll finish Bushy-Brows off right now!

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:45.520
Huh?

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:47.600
Naruto seems confused...

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:52.020
What's up, Naruto?

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:53.860
Um...

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:57.530
I need to borrow something
from you, Sakura...

00:09:58.570 --> 00:10:00.990
"Find the girl who stole your
heart on that fateful day,

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:02.580
and borrow her..."

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:09.930
I just need them for a minute...

00:10:13.260 --> 00:10:14.380
Oh, dear!

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:20.050
<b>Red Team</b>

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:20.050
<b>White Team</b>

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:16.670
We need someone to check on Naruto!

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:20.050
What in the world was on that paper?

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:34.940
<b>Chicken Fights are 
Part of the Thrill of Youth</b>

00:10:37.810 --> 00:10:42.870
The scavenger hunt has been called
off due to an injured participant.

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:47.630
The real problem with that race
was the lottery, not the injury.

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:45.380
Sorry.

00:10:45.380 --> 00:10:48.170
It's no big deal.

00:10:48.170 --> 00:10:50.050
Next we'll begin the red team versus...

00:10:50.050 --> 00:10:52.040
...white team cheerleading competition.

00:10:52.510 --> 00:10:54.090
Cheerleading competition?

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:57.810
I have to win the next one.

00:10:57.810 --> 00:10:58.930
I will win!

00:10:58.930 --> 00:10:59.810
Definitely win!

00:10:59.810 --> 00:11:01.520
Yeah, I'll win for sure!

00:11:01.520 --> 00:11:02.350
I can win.

00:11:02.350 --> 00:11:03.850
What's wrong with winning?

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:05.520
Is there a law against it?

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:08.070
<i>Maybe it would help him a
little if I cheered him on.</i>

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:11.270
<b>Champion</b>

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:20.200
<i>But I'd be way too embarrassed to wear a cheerleading uniform...</i>

00:11:25.340 --> 00:11:27.370
Oh, well, I'll do it for Lee!

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:32.630
Go, go, white team!

00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:35.090
No, this is wrong! Somehow this is wrong!

00:11:35.430 --> 00:11:37.850
Fight, fight, white team!

00:11:37.850 --> 00:11:39.970
Fight, fight, white team!

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:41.020
Like, totally!

00:11:41.020 --> 00:11:43.090
That's definitely wrong!
A million times more wrong!

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:47.060
<b>Red Team</b>

00:11:43.380 --> 00:11:45.190
Hooray, hooray, red team!

00:11:45.190 --> 00:11:47.060
Hooray, hooray, red team!

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:49.480
You rock, Sakura!

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:51.720
I'll do my best, too, Sakura!

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:56.990
Hey, why are you motivated
by the enemy team?!

00:11:56.990 --> 00:11:58.740
I'm sorry!

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:01.370
It's on to our next event.

00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:03.370
This time it's the tug-of-war!

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:05.160
Unlike most tugs-of-war,

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:07.870
these will be one-on-one matches.

00:12:08.880 --> 00:12:10.340
Does our color commentator,

00:12:10.340 --> 00:12:13.300
Lady Tsunade, have any
insight as to how to win?

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:14.590
Luck.

00:12:14.590 --> 00:12:15.880
You heard her, folks...

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:20.600
You ready, Lee?

00:12:20.600 --> 00:12:22.100
Of course.

00:12:22.100 --> 00:12:26.050
Guy Sensei said if I believed
in myself, I'd win for sure.

00:12:26.360 --> 00:12:29.770
Okay, but let me know
if you need anything.

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:31.820
I'm here to help.

00:12:32.210 --> 00:12:33.730
I'm fine!

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:36.020
I'll show everyone I can win on my own.

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:40.480
<b>Red Team</b>

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:40.480
<b>White Team</b>

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:43.450
Go.

00:12:53.150 --> 00:12:57.340
Lee and Naruto are evenly matched!

00:12:57.340 --> 00:13:00.340
Wait, Lee has taken a small lead!

00:13:01.350 --> 00:13:03.010
Sexy Jutsu!

00:13:03.890 --> 00:13:04.770
Hi!

00:13:06.600 --> 00:13:10.760
A dirty move by Naruto,
but effective nonetheless!

00:13:11.640 --> 00:13:14.360
Fine, I'll counter with my own ninjutsu!

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:17.360
Lee, you know you can't use—

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:20.190
You just changed your clothes!

00:13:20.430 --> 00:13:22.990
Time to wrap this up!

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:26.950
Naruto moves in for the kill with

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:29.000
the Shadow Clone Jutsu!

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:31.080
Why didn't you just use
that to begin with?!

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:32.840
Gotcha, Bushy-Brows!

00:13:32.840 --> 00:13:35.420
<i>I refuse to lose...</i>

00:13:35.420 --> 00:13:37.590
'Scuse me...

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:40.500
It's here!

00:13:42.010 --> 00:13:43.170
W-What's that?

00:13:43.720 --> 00:13:48.060
A Mr. Rock Lee ordered a devil. 
Where might he be?

00:13:48.980 --> 00:13:50.230
That's me.

00:13:50.230 --> 00:13:52.690
Oh, I apologize, Master!

00:13:52.690 --> 00:13:55.520
How may I be of service to you?

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:59.190
Can you help me with this tug-of-war?

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:01.240
Understood, Master.

00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:05.200
The sweet devil joins the fray!

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:07.660
He's brought Lee back
from the jaws of defeat!

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:11.460
Isn't it supposed to be one-on-one?

00:14:11.460 --> 00:14:16.750
Technically, I think Naruto was
the first one to break the rule.

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:19.170
Forget the rules, that's a
devil for crying out loud!

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:21.540
We have to keep things in-universe!

00:14:22.010 --> 00:14:24.090
What's your analysis, Lady Tsunade?

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:26.930
The rule does state matches
must be one-on-one.

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:28.100
They lucked out.

00:14:28.100 --> 00:14:29.020
Huh?

00:14:29.020 --> 00:14:30.510
You heard her, folks.

00:14:30.560 --> 00:14:32.060
This is insane!

00:14:32.060 --> 00:14:34.750
Forget it. I'll win with brute force!

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:48.620
Both competitors go flying!

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:52.710
The decision now rests with the referee!

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:55.670
Kakashi Sensei!

00:14:55.670 --> 00:14:56.880
Who won?

00:14:56.880 --> 00:14:58.880
Oh, um...

00:14:59.610 --> 00:15:01.300
Sorry, I wasn't paying attention.

00:15:03.800 --> 00:15:07.090
We'll now break for lunch.

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:09.590
Want something to eat, Lee?

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:12.310
No, thanks. I'm trying to stay in the zone.

00:15:12.310 --> 00:15:14.770
Oh. Then how about a shoulder rub?

00:15:14.770 --> 00:15:16.520
You must be pretty beat.

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:18.900
I want to focus on finding
a way to beat Naruto,

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:22.560
lunches and shoulder rubs
are only going to distract me.

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:25.070
It's fine to put the competition first,

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:28.030
but maybe you shouldn't try
to do everything on your own.

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:30.870
Why not?

00:15:30.870 --> 00:15:32.950
This is my battle.

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:35.110
I guess, but...

00:15:41.090 --> 00:15:43.790
The time for our final event has come.

00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:46.550
Last up is the chicken fight!

00:15:47.100 --> 00:15:49.010
Teams of four will duke it out,

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:50.510
trying to take their opponent's hat,

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:52.680
or knock them off their
teammates' shoulders.

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:55.470
The last group standing wins!

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:55.470
<b>Winner</b>

00:15:56.190 --> 00:16:00.150
Lady Tsunade, what's the key to winning a competition like this?

00:16:00.150 --> 00:16:01.530
Luck.

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:04.980
Is that all you can say
today, Lady Tsunade?

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:10.200
That's not a chicken, it's a horse!

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:12.660
I stayed up all night making it.

00:16:12.660 --> 00:16:16.100
Hop in here and you'll
feel like a thoroughbred!

00:16:16.690 --> 00:16:18.290
Where's Neji, anyway?

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:20.670
We need four people to compete.

00:16:20.670 --> 00:16:23.590
No time, the two of us will
have to be the vehicle.

00:16:23.590 --> 00:16:27.130
You really want me to get
in that thing with you?!

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:35.810
Lee, we're short one
person, don't go crazy.

00:16:35.810 --> 00:16:37.100
I don't think so.

00:16:37.980 --> 00:16:39.980
This is the final battle.

00:16:39.980 --> 00:16:43.150
I'll beat Naruto by myself,
no matter what it takes!

00:16:43.150 --> 00:16:45.480
You keep saying that...

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:49.940
Hold on tight and go.

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:51.620
Charge!

00:16:51.620 --> 00:16:54.200
No, we should be retreating—

00:16:55.950 --> 00:16:58.320
Lee's vehicle, conspicuous for its

00:16:58.320 --> 00:16:59.710
appearance and being short one person,

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:02.540
quickly finds itself
surrounded by the red team!

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:04.510
Lee's in a tight spot!

00:17:04.510 --> 00:17:06.000
You don't have to rub it in!

00:17:06.050 --> 00:17:07.460
I've got this!

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:10.430
Leaf Un, Deux, Trois!

00:17:10.970 --> 00:17:11.760
Yeah!

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:13.760
When did you hide that tutu?

00:17:14.890 --> 00:17:16.390
Hornet Stinger!

00:17:16.390 --> 00:17:17.930
Stop spinning!

00:17:18.260 --> 00:17:20.690
We'll just knock him off their shoulders!

00:17:21.230 --> 00:17:22.360
The horse is gone?!

00:17:25.150 --> 00:17:27.780
Nice try, I used the Replacement Jutsu!

00:17:27.780 --> 00:17:29.440
Good one, Guy Sensei!

00:17:29.450 --> 00:17:31.780
No, you didn't, you just
jumped out of the costume!

00:17:32.160 --> 00:17:33.620
Elimination by Depantsification!

00:17:33.620 --> 00:17:35.030
Too many layers!

00:17:35.290 --> 00:17:36.450
Keep it up, Lee.

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:38.910
You're really moving up now!

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:41.450
Guy Sensei, please pull
your pants back up!

00:17:42.500 --> 00:17:44.340
So it's come down to this.

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:45.210
Leaf Crapsho-

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:47.170
You're not using that one!

00:17:51.140 --> 00:17:52.510
Ow...

00:17:52.510 --> 00:17:54.300
Are you nuts, trying to
use the Leaf Crapshoot...

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:56.140
...while you're standing on our shoulders?!

00:17:56.140 --> 00:17:57.520
I'm sorry...

00:17:57.520 --> 00:17:59.140
Do you see now, Lee?

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:01.010
See what?

00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:04.440
You finally started using
your real strength.

00:18:04.440 --> 00:18:06.530
Didn't you? Didn't you?

00:18:07.070 --> 00:18:07.980
Yes...

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:12.070
You've been trying to fight
on your own all day.

00:18:12.440 --> 00:18:13.380
It's understandable.

00:18:13.380 --> 00:18:16.240
There are a lot of solo events
at these sports meets.

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:18.370
But!

00:18:18.370 --> 00:18:19.950
It's when you're fighting alone that

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:22.530
you need the support of 
your friends the most!

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:24.640
The support of my friends?

00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:26.630
What do you mean?

00:18:26.630 --> 00:18:28.000
Like I said...

00:18:28.430 --> 00:18:30.220
<i>Have faith in yourself!</i>

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:34.050
<i>If you just go in with your usual
level of focus, you'll win for sure!</i>

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:36.470
<i>Remember that!</i>

00:18:37.220 --> 00:18:39.640
You should understand
what I'm saying by now.

00:18:39.640 --> 00:18:42.930
When do you have the
most confidence in yourself?

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:54.360
When I'm with my friends.

00:18:55.870 --> 00:18:58.530
You think you can beat Naruto now?

00:18:59.160 --> 00:19:00.080
Yes!

00:19:06.630 --> 00:19:09.130
The battle enters its final round!

00:19:09.130 --> 00:19:11.630
It's Lee versus Naruto, winner take all!

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:12.590
Luck.

00:19:12.590 --> 00:19:14.880
I didn't ask you anything.

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:18.510
The cheers have reached a fever pitch.

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:20.720
Who will emerge victorious?!

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:22.940
Let's go, Naruto!

00:19:24.060 --> 00:19:25.100
Yeah!

00:19:28.610 --> 00:19:29.730
<i>He's strong!</i>

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:30.940
<i>Nothing less from Naruto—</i>

00:19:31.820 --> 00:19:32.900
Lee!

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:36.230
Gotcha, Bushy-Brows!

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:39.400
Lee's inches away from defeat!

00:19:40.580 --> 00:19:43.830
<i>I can't lose now...</i>

00:19:44.580 --> 00:19:49.370
<i>I can't disappoint the
friends who support me!</i>

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:50.530
Sorry I'm so late!

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:52.970
That voice!

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:01.010
Neji!

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:16.300
Neji reappears out of nowhere with
"a somewhat melancholy ghost!"

00:20:32.880 --> 00:20:34.670
Ouch...

00:20:39.220 --> 00:20:41.640
Lee wins an incredible comeback!

00:20:41.640 --> 00:20:44.020
Neji, completely oblivious to
the dramatic atmosphere,

00:20:44.020 --> 00:20:47.140
literally propels Lee to a
huge comeback victory!

00:20:49.940 --> 00:20:52.730
I lost this one.

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:53.860
Naruto...

00:20:53.860 --> 00:20:56.700
I'll get you next time, though!

00:20:56.700 --> 00:20:59.740
Next time it'll be one-on-one
for real, though.

00:20:59.740 --> 00:21:00.490
Sure!

00:21:00.490 --> 00:21:02.280
But even if it is,

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:04.290
can I still have my friends
come cheer for me?

00:21:04.290 --> 00:21:07.080
Of course! I'd want my
friends there, too.

00:21:07.330 --> 00:21:10.130
Well, I'm glad you managed
to beat Naruto.

00:21:10.750 --> 00:21:12.670
I didn't do it on my own.

00:21:12.670 --> 00:21:14.090
We all won!

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:19.010
Friends are wonderful, aren't they, Lee?

00:21:19.010 --> 00:21:20.260
Yes.

00:21:20.260 --> 00:21:22.200
As we run through the days ahead,

00:21:22.200 --> 00:21:23.850
we must always cherish our friends!

00:21:23.850 --> 00:21:25.310
Follow me!

00:21:25.310 --> 00:21:27.010
Yes, sir, Guy Sensei!

00:21:27.270 --> 00:21:29.020
Wait up, I'm coming, too!

00:21:29.020 --> 00:21:30.100
Me, too!

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:31.400
Me, too!

00:21:31.400 --> 00:21:32.400
Me, too...

00:21:32.400 --> 00:21:35.020
You don't need that many friends!

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:37.390
Ow!

00:23:21.170 --> 00:23:22.670
This week's horoscopes:

00:23:22.670 --> 00:23:24.840
The worst goes to A-type Sagittarii.

00:23:24.840 --> 00:23:26.640
You are highly susceptible 
to a string of bad luck.

00:23:26.640 --> 00:23:29.460
Avoid be sure to avoid contact 
with B-type Scorpios.

00:23:29.460 --> 00:23:31.400
Lee, aren't you an A-type Sagittarius?

00:23:31.400 --> 00:23:32.850
I don't believe in horoscopes―

00:23:32.850 --> 00:23:35.230
Ah, a bird pooped on my head!

00:23:34.810 --> 00:23:40.520
<b>Orochimaru is a B-Type Scorpio
Love Letters are the Ultimate Trap</b>

00:23:35.230 --> 00:23:36.050
Next week,

00:23:36.050 --> 00:23:38.100
"Orochimaru is a B-Type Scorpio,"

00:23:38.100 --> 00:23:40.520
and "Love Letters are the Ultimate Trap."

00:23:40.520 --> 00:23:43.980
Ugh, I stepped in dog poop!

00:23:43.980 --> 00:23:46.360
Hey, you guys, wait―

00:23:46.820 --> 00:23:48.890
Where did this washbasin come from?
